'use strict';
// Canonical physical stock owned by Admin. Original product rows and every old
// receipt remain untouched. Keys retain their source namespace; duplicate SKUs
// are never merged. All money below is exact USD cents.
//
// Durable checkout: reserve stock + immutable instruction in Main, save Main,
// call the idempotent business receipt writer, then save the claim in Main.
// The two databases are NOT an atomic transaction. A prepared instruction must
// be resumed with its original request ID, never submitted as a replacement.
//
// Callbacks commitSale/settleTransfer MUST persist their own debit/receipt once
// by operation.requestId and reject changed snapshots. They return a plain
// object {requestId,state:'completed',saleId,receipt} (transfer has no saleId).
// assertOpen(workspaceId,date) must reject closed ledgers and other financial
// locks. The caller must take/verify a backup BEFORE initialize().
